.fill.justify.offset 5.rightmargin 70.pagesize 72.m1 3.m2 2.m3 2.m4 5.ec \.header /Newgrp/System/Newgrp.footer /Page #//Printed (%)/.in +5.define topic.bold.in -5$1 $2 $3 $4 $5.in +5.en.define endtopic.en.define noform.nojustify.nofill.en.define noformend.justify.fill.en.! Manual created with MWB.! END-OF-MACRO.topic NAMENewgrp - Change your current group-id.endtopic.topic SYNOPSIS.noformnewgrp <grpid>newgrp <grpname>.noformend.endtopic.topic DESCRIPTIONNewgrp allows you (if you have the permissions) to hange to anothergroup. This is useful to change files owned by another group to whichyou normally have no access. To change to a group your username must bein the /dd/SYS/group file as a member of this group. If a group has apassword in the group file you can change to this group when you knowthe password even if you are not in the list of members..endtopic.topic FILES.noform/dd/SYS/group.noformend.endtopic.topic AUTHOR.in 0.ce 4Ulrich DessauerKerschensteinerstr. 45, D-8034 GermeringVoice: +49 89 8417811E-Mail: ..!{chiuur|doitcr}!nitmar!ud.endtopic